 포함, 대표팀에서 106경기를 뛰며 49골을 기록했다.","date":"2025-10-20T20:00:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2025/10/21/DZ5IIWJPWVDYFJXLJMHTRXN4IA/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"[일사일언] 서로 다른 리듬으로 공존하기","partialText":"","date":"2025-10-20T15:40:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2025/10/21/K7FPVJQGO5CDNLQCZKE7E25HDQ/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"[요즘 유행 탐구] “내 귀에 캔디♬” 사탕 물자 입안서 K팝 콘서트가!","partialText":"","date":"2025-10-20T15:40:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2025/10/21/AN2T3P44ERCWDF66M2NKAMQWIU/"}]